#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Entries without atom coordinates, as COD keeps them for structures it has
# only bibliographic data for: an atom site loop whose one row is all `?`.
# The first block has a cell but neither coordinates nor symmetry and fails
# with "no atom sites"; the second has no cell either and is skipped as a
# block without a structure.
# Hand-written test fixture for Materials Workbench (mw-crystal-io); the
# layout follows COD entries 1000195 and 1001012, no values are copied.
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

data_cell_only
_chemical_formula_sum             'B2 F8 Sr'
_cell_length_a                    9.5
_cell_length_b                    9.2
_cell_length_c                    13.8
_cell_angle_alpha                 90
_cell_angle_beta                  90
_cell_angle_gamma                 90
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
? ? ? ?

data_no_cell
_chemical_formula_sum             'Ca H4 N2 O8'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
? ? ? ?
